DESCRIPTION >
    Dashboard: live visitor count, trailing 5 minutes. Tenant-scoped; prunes
    via (site_id, timestamp). Faithful 1:1 port of api/routes/dashboard.js:524-528
    (queryName 'live_visitors' in source — renamed dashboard_live_visitors here
    to avoid collision with live.js:22, which ALSO uses queryName 'live_visitors'
    but is a DIFFERENT query keyed on bag properties.anonymous_id, not
    distinct_id; that one is deferred to the bag-anonymous_id batch). Identity
    rule #19a: count(DISTINCT distinct_id) — canonical stitching key, no
    argMin/argMax. Typed-column translation (SCOPE_v3.md §2.6):
    properties.site_id -> site_id, event -> event_type. No JSON-bag fields.
    NOT YET PUSHED — validated read-only via `tb --cloud sql` only.

NODE dashboard_live_visitors_node
SQL >
    %
    SELECT count(DISTINCT distinct_id) AS live_visitors
    FROM events
    WHERE site_id = {{ String(site_id, required=True) }}
      AND event_type = '$pageview'
      AND timestamp >= now() - INTERVAL 5 MINUTE

TYPE endpoint
